'''Daenerys Targaryen''' is the daughter of [[Aerys II Targaryen]]. She hatches three dragons.
==History==
Daenerys was born on [[Dragonstone]] in [[284 AC]] and grew up in exile in the [[Free Cities]].
In [[297 AC]] she and her brother came to [[Pentos]], to the manse of [[Illyrio Mopatis]].
In [[298 AC]] she is betrothed to [[Khal Drogo]].
==Recent Events==
===A Game of Thrones===
Daenerys weds [[Khal Drogo]]. She walks into a funeral pyre and emerges with three dragons.
